{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cruel Emperor's army holds the lands captive. A lone hero wielding a cursed blade is all that stands against them...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE CUT, ONE KILL.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrusted with a cursed sword, you are able to strike down foes in a single blow. However, your enemies can do the same against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TRECHEROUS JOURNEY...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, block, dodge, deflect, and climb your way through dozens of unique environments over five chapters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ARMY OF FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those loyal to the Emperor seek to eliminate you. Fend off warriors wielding blades, shields, explosives, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466580/extras/7f3ef0c775b8274d79a9fa2917fc91b4.avif?t=1756742330\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VIRTUES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking a challenge? Virtues offer challenges for every level. Can you achieve them all?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Army of One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3466580/323844eeffd85a0ca83eb56811c44235ea1f2b0c.jpg"},{"name":"A Long Hike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3466580/3470bcd36fc34477bef5272540a59832b5026e51.jpg"},{"name":"Downtown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3466580/9e529188ed982a5304c2927b4b7140bbe2db4ef4.jpg"},{"name":"Giddy Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3466580/240a8ee16fe38307e34e5591ea786580f01470ce.jpg"},{"name":"Savior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3466580/d8deba308c06f90a83d1483ecab7ba61e15